  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe issue https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10677 proposed breaking text into clusters to be able to display one cluster at a time. It shows only one useful example for this proposal: drawing text on a path. However using the same API `getTextClusters()` for displaying text on a horizontal line will be very inefficient if the text has the same style. Unless there is reason for displaying text cluster by cluster it should be displayed as on text run.",
